    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d663">

                <pb facs="0636" n="1370" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1370"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr. Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-12-04"><hi rendition="#italic">December 4, 1895</hi></date>.
                        (Received Dec. 23.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 705.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose for your
                    information copy of a letter from Rev. Mr. Gates, at Harpoot, detailing the
                    atrocities committed in that city, and which leaves no doubt that missionary
                    buildings were burned and plundered by Turks and Koords. Indemnity will be
                    demanded as soon as the amount of the loss at Marash is known and your further
                    instructions are received.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">A. W. Terrell.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d663-a1.xml" xpointer="d663-a1"/>
